 bit small, but if you're still hungry you can order another one or try another dish.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Port Louis"},{"id":"port_louis_wv_first_restaurant","areaId":"port_louis","name":"First Restaurant","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":-20.1609,"lng":57.5041},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"port_louis_wv_first_restaurant","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["firstrestaurant","portlouis"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Traditional Cantonese cuisine with a large menu, this restaurant particularly suitable for groups. Great food at reasonable prices have made it possibly the most popular restaurant in Chinatown.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Port Louis"},{"id":"port_louis_wv_la_bonne_marmite","areaId":"port_louis","name":"La Bonne Marmite","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":-20.16205,"lng":57.50324},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"port_louis_wv_la_bonne_marmite","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.bonnemarmite.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["labonnemarmite","portlouis"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Described as one of the best restaurants outside the waterfront area, they have Creole, Indian and Chinese dishes on the menu and the staff is always friendly.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Port Louis"},{"id":"port_louis_wv_namaste","areaId":"port_loui